00:33:19.322 --> 00:33:21.361
from wherever the heck I am.

00:33:21.361 --> 00:33:23.853
We're filming this right
now, it will be consumed

00:33:23.853 --> 00:33:28.130
in Europe, and Canada,
and South America, and so

00:33:28.130 --> 00:33:30.364
that is the beauty of the internet.

00:33:30.364 --> 00:33:32.105
- [Interviewer] Yeah,
absolutely, and so no plans

00:33:32.105 --> 00:33:33.241
