00:33:38.205 --> 00:33:40.438
- Near the Jets, by the
way, that is incredible,

00:33:40.438 --> 00:33:43.724
I am not joking, that
is the actual reason.

00:33:43.724 --> 00:33:44.716
- [Interviewer] Is it? (laughs)

00:33:44.716 --> 00:33:45.693
- That is the actual reason.

00:33:45.693 --> 00:33:47.759
- [Interviewer] I thought
it might be, I saw the--

00:33:47.759 --> 00:33:50.293
- It is the actual reason.

