01:01:37.401 --> 01:01:39.857
- Hurry up, man, but no, but--
- Thank you.

01:01:39.857 --> 01:01:40.926
- So pleased to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.

01:01:40.926 --> 01:01:42.498
- And I'm excited for
you to come to Singapore.

01:01:42.498 --> 01:01:43.673
- Thank you.
