and Twitter and Tumblr.

01:03:27.108 --> 01:03:30.077
I haven't had the same
luxury with Blockchain.

01:03:30.077 --> 01:03:32.283
You know, the last, you know, it's funny,

01:03:32.283 --> 01:03:34.845
a lot of, you know, probably
two, three years ago,

01:03:34.845 --> 01:03:37.454
