01:03:44.954 --> 01:03:47.333
and show them that I bought, you know,

01:03:47.333 --> 01:03:49.331
I bought Bitcoin in 2014,
and everyone was like,

01:03:49.331 --> 01:03:50.600
what the fuck, you know?

01:03:50.600 --> 01:03:53.604
But I didn't have the
luxury of going deep.

01:03:53.604 --> 01:03:55.866
But what's very obvious to me,
and I think you've heard this

01:03:55.866 --> 01:03:58.130
