you're referencing, is,

01:03:58.130 --> 01:04:00.358
I'm very good at pattern recognition.

01:04:00.358 --> 01:04:03.621
And the Blockchain technology is very easy

01:04:03.621 --> 01:04:07.480
to understand, it's
disproportionally valuable to people.

01:04:07.480 --> 01:04:10.310
It's going to cut out a
lot of in between things

01:04:10.310 --> 01:04:12.692
