01:34:01.744 --> 01:34:05.701
One of your fans in the
Middle East is asking,

01:34:05.701 --> 01:34:07.244
what's the best way to grow a community

01:34:07.244 --> 01:34:11.230
of people on social media from nothing?

01:34:11.230 --> 01:34:14.761
- By not worrying about the growth.

01:34:14.761 --> 01:34:18.033
I think almost everybody,
when they start at zero,

01:34:18.033 --> 01:34:20.829
are so insecure that all
these people have tens

01:34:20.829 --> 01:34:23.067
of thousands, and millions, and a lot

01:34:23.067 --> 01:34:25.389
of people right now feel
like they're catching up,

01:34:25.389 --> 01:34:28.028
whether that's an A-list
celebrity, which is why a lot

01:34:28.028 --> 01:34:32.485
of A-list celebrities from
traditional media are struggling

01:34:32.485 --> 01:34:34.480
on social, they don't like the perception

01:34:34.480 --> 01:34:37.211
that they're not big, so
they're staying off completely,

01:34:37.211 --> 01:34:40.147
or if it's just an average Joe or Jane

01:34:40.147 --> 01:34:42.019
that are trying to get onboard.

01:34:42.019 --> 01:34:45.631
So, a, don't pander to the numbers, b,

01:34:45.631 --> 01:34:50.566
bring value, and whatever
value you have to the audience.

01:34:50.566 --> 01:34:52.401
Don't fake it till you'll make it,

01:34:52.401 --> 01:34:53.952
because there's too much content,

01:34:53.952 --> 01:34:55.748
it doesn't work the way it used to.

01:34:55.748 --> 01:34:57.986
And, you know, I think of it as, like,

01:34:57.986 --> 01:35:00.018
