my entire life with weights,

01:35:05.283 --> 01:35:08.046
I had none, and so that first
year was, like, painful,

01:35:08.046 --> 01:35:09.707
like, eight pushups, real pushups,

01:35:09.707 --> 01:35:11.367
not like the fake ones, were hard.

01:35:11.367 --> 01:35:13.221
But understanding that I was gonna do this

01:35:13.221 --> 01:35:16.792
for the rest of my life
was what really allowed it

01:35:16.792 --> 01:35:18.987
to be palpable in those first two years,

01:35:18.987 --> 01:35:21.038
when it seemed daunting.

01:35:21.038 --> 01:35:23.136
And somebody starting a social
media account right now,

01:35:23.136 --> 01:35:25.723
knowing that this is something
they want to use for the rest

01:35:25.723 --> 01:35:28.505
of their lives, all of
a sudden, how you do

01:35:28.505 --> 01:35:31.483
in the first six months doesn't
feel like a failure anymore

01:35:31.483 --> 01:35:33.236
when you know you're doing it forever.

01:35:33.236 --> 01:35:34.911
So having the right
perspective and framework

01:35:34.911 --> 01:35:38.183
